# Logs
# Runtime logs only. Anchored: an unanchored `logs/` also matches `docs/logs/`,
# which is documentation and belongs in the repo — that collision is what the
# per-month re-include rules here were working around.
/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

